The input limits for scoring 100 points are (subproblems G1+G2+G3): 

  * 0 ≤ n ≤ 10. 
  * The length of string s and the maximum length of string p is  ≤ 50000. 

Output

Print a single integer — the number of good substrings of string s.

Examples

